<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arbor Health Care upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arbor Health Care upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Robertson Stephens &amp; Co research analyst Sheryl Skolnick raised the rating today on Arbor Health Care Co to buy from long-term attractive.</p>
<p>- She cited increased margins and revenues.</p>
